20
00:00:41,413 --> 00:00:44,216
TIFFANY'S FLIPPANT ATTITUDE
TRULY UPSET ME.

21
00:00:44,216 --> 00:00:45,617
THIS IS A JOKE TO YOU.

22
00:00:45,617 --> 00:00:47,185
I BEEN THROUGH STUFF
SO I'M ANGRY.

23
00:00:47,185 --> 00:00:48,720
BUT THIS IS NOT--

24
00:00:48,720 --> 00:00:49,955
BE QUIET, TIFFANY.

25
00:00:49,955 --> 00:00:51,256
BUT EVERYBODY DON'T--

26
00:00:51,256 --> 00:00:52,624
BE QUIET! STOP IT!

27
