I HAVE NEVER IN MY LIFE YELLED
AT A GIRL LIKE THIS.

28
00:00:55,594 --> 00:00:57,529
NOW AFTER
THE SURPRISE DOUBLE CUT,

29
00:00:57,529 --> 00:00:58,964
ONLY SEVEN GIRLS
REMAIN.

30
00:00:58,964 --> 00:01:02,567
WHO WILL BE
ELIMINATED TONIGHT?

31
00:01:02,567 --> 00:01:06,838
