I CANNOT BELIEVE
WHAT JUST HAPPENED.

34
00:01:57,722 --> 00:01:59,891
ELIMINATION
WAS CRAZY.

35
00:01:59,891 --> 00:02:02,394
I WASN'T REALLY EXPECTING,
YOU KNOW,

36
00:02:02,394 --> 00:02:04,262
WHAT HAPPENED
TONIGHT.

37
00:02:06,865 --> 00:02:08,733
BOTH OF YOU
WILL PACK YOUR BAGS.

38
00:02:10,635 --> 00:02:11,636
COME ON,
COME ON.

39
00:02:11,636 --> 00:02:13,205
