MAYBE I AM ANGRY
INSIDE.

44
00:02:20,879 --> 00:02:22,480
I BEEN THROUGH STUFF
SO I'M ANGRY.

45
00:02:22,480 --> 00:02:23,615
BUT THIS IS NOT--

46
