UNH, UNH, UNH.

47
00:02:24,783 --> 00:02:25,884
BE QUIET, TIFFANY.

48
00:02:25,884 --> 00:02:27,452
BE QUIET!

49
00:02:27,452 --> 00:02:28,353
WHAT IS WRONG
WITH YOU?

50
00:02:28,353 --> 00:02:31,556
STOP IT!

51
00:02:31,556 --> 00:02:34,226
WHEN MY MOTHER YELLS LIKE THIS,
IT'S BECAUSE SHE LOVES ME!

52
00:02:34,226 --> 00:02:35,460
I WAS ROOTING
FOR YOU!

53
00:02:35,460 --> 00:02:36,461
WE WERE ALL
ROOTING FOR YOU!

54
00:02:36,461 --> 00:02:37,829
HOW DARE YOU!

55
00:02:37,829 --> 00:02:39,397
LEARN SOMETHING
FROM THIS!

56
00:02:41,633 --> 00:02:43,201
TIFFANY COULD HAVE WON.

57
00:02:43,201 --> 00:02:47,372
SHE COULD HAVE BEEN
THE TOP MODEL, BUT...

58
00:02:47,372 --> 00:02:49,541
EVERYBODY WAS ROOTING FOR HER,
EXCEPT FOR HERSELF.

59
00:02:49,541 --> 00:02:50,876
EXCEPT FOR HERSELF.

60
00:02:50,876 --> 00:02:53,612
THEY ELIMINATED
BOTH OF THEM.

61
00:02:56,414 --> 00:02:57,349
HELLO.

62
00:02:58,583 --> 00:03:00,218
HELLO.

63
00:03:00,218 --> 00:03:00,852
HOW ARE YOU GUYS?

64
00:03:00,852 --> 00:03:01,653
HOW ARE YOU GUYS DOING?

65
00:03:01,653 --> 00:03:02,387
GOOD.

66
00:03:02,387 --> 00:03:05,357
I WANTED TO TALK TO YOU GUYS
ABOUT JUDGING BECAUSE I BLEW UP,

67
00:03:05,357 --> 00:03:06,491
AND IT WAS PROBABLY SCARY
FOR YOU GUYS.

68
00:03:06,491 --> 00:03:07,759
BUT I JUST WANT YOU
TO UNDERSTAND

69
00:03:07,759 --> 00:03:09,394
WHERE THAT COMES FROM.

70
00:03:09,394 --> 00:03:10,795
I UNDERSTAND THAT THERE IS
TIMES WHEN YOU MAY FEEL LIKE

71
00:03:10,795 --> 00:03:13,365
YOU WANT TO GO HOME
AND WANT TO GIVE UP.

72
00:03:13,365 --> 00:03:14,466
I'VE BEEN
THROUGH THAT.

73
00:03:14,466 --> 00:03:15,834
CALLING MY MOM
WHEN I LIVED IN PARIS,

74
00:03:15,834 --> 00:03:17,636
LIKE, "I CAN'T
DO THIS ANYMORE,"

75
00:03:17,636 --> 00:03:19,638
'CAUSE I WENT THROUGH
HORRIBLE THINGS IN THE INDUSTRY.

76
00:03:19,638 --> 00:03:21,439
PEOPLE TRYIN' TO DO
EVERYTHING IN THEIR POWER

77
00:03:21,439 --> 00:03:23,575
TO MAKE ME GO HOME
AND TO MAKE ME GIVE UP.

78
00:03:23,575 --> 00:03:25,543
WITH TIFFANY, I THINK SHE'S JUST
BEEN THROUGH SO MUCH,

79
00:03:25,543 --> 00:03:27,679
SHE CAN'T SEE
HOW SPECIAL SHE IS.

80
00:03:27,679 --> 00:03:29,781
AND WHEN I SAW HER GIVE UP
IN THAT JUDGING ROOM,

81
00:03:29,781 --> 00:03:31,516
IT JUST
PISSED ME OFF.

82
00:03:31,516 --> 00:03:33,685
BECAUSE I'M,
LIKE,

83
00:03:33,685 --> 00:03:36,855
THIS IS A TURNING POINT
IN YOUR LIFE, YOU KNOW?

84
00:03:36,855 --> 00:03:38,390
YOU SINK
OR YOU SWIM.

85
00:03:38,390 --> 00:03:39,791
AND TO SEE SOMEBODY
JUST LAUGH AT IT

86
00:03:39,791 --> 00:03:42,427
AND THROW IT AWAY
JUST REALLY UPSET ME.

87
00:03:42,427 --> 00:03:44,529
WE ALL SAW
THE DEFEATED THING ALSO.

88
00:03:44,529 --> 00:03:47,332
LIKE, SHE HAD ALREADY GIVEN UP
AND WE ALL SAW THAT.

89
00:03:47,332 --> 00:03:48,466
I JUST WANTED YOU GUYS
TO UNDERSTAND

90
00:03:48,466 --> 00:03:50,635
WHERE THAT
WAS COMING FROM FROM ME.

91
00:03:50,635 --> 00:03:52,337
ALL RIGHT?

92
00:03:52,337 --> 00:03:54,239
TIFFANY--HER HEART
WASN'T IN IT.

93
00:03:54,239 --> 00:03:56,608
I REALLY FELT LIKE
SHE WAS VERY PASSIVE ABOUT IT.

94
00:03:56,608 --> 00:03:59,377
WE HAVE TO JUST TAKE IT
INTO OUR OWN HANDS

95
00:03:59,377 --> 00:04:01,179
OF WHAT WE WANT
TO HAPPEN FOR OUR--

96
00:04:01,179 --> 00:04:02,414
YOU KNOW,
OUR FUTURE.

97
00:04:02,414 --> 00:04:03,648
I HOPE YOU UNDERSTAND
HOW MUCH IT IS ABOUT

98
00:04:03,648 --> 00:04:05,216
GIVING YOUR ALL,

99
00:04:05,216 --> 00:04:07,252
AND HOW MUCH IT IS ABOUT
FIGHTING UNTIL THE END.

100
00:04:07,252 --> 00:04:09,721
IT'S AN EMOTIONAL
ROLLER COASTER HERE.

101
00:04:09,721 --> 00:04:11,823
BUT THIS IS SOMETHING
THAT'S ONLY GONNA HAPPEN TO ME

102
00:04:11,823 --> 00:04:13,258
ONCE
IN MY LIFETIME.

103
00:04:13,258 --> 00:04:14,659
YOU KNOW,
I WANT TO PROVE TO PEOPLE THAT

104
00:04:14,659 --> 00:04:17,462
EVEN THOUGH I AM NOT AS PRETTY
AS SOME OF THESE GIRLS,

105
00:04:17,462 --> 00:04:19,197
YOU KNOW, I'M GONNA DO IT
NO MATTER WHAT.

106
00:04:20,498 --> 00:04:22,834
OKAY, BYE.

107
00:04:22,834 --> 00:04:24,536
THAT MADE ME FEEL
A LOT BETTER.

108
00:04:28,540 --> 00:04:29,941
YOU SURE,
MICHELLE?

109
00:04:29,941 --> 00:04:31,343
MICHELLE'S GONNA SAY,

110
00:04:31,343 --> 00:04:33,211
"I SHOULDA DONE
SO MUCH BETTER."

111
00:04:33,211 --> 00:04:34,346
NO, I BEEN WORKING
ON THAT.

112
00:04:34,346 --> 00:04:35,447
THAT'S WHY I JOKE
ABOUT IT.

113
00:04:35,447 --> 00:04:37,749
