I CAN TELL.

114
00:04:37,749 --> 00:04:39,184
I AM HARD ON MYSELF
AND EVERYTHING,

115
00:04:39,184 --> 00:04:41,586
BUT I'M TRYING TO STOP
BEATING MYSELF UP

116
00:04:41,586 --> 00:04:44,723
OVER THINGS
THAT I CAN'T CHANGE.

117
00:04:44,723 --> 00:04:48,493
THROUGH THIS ENTIRE PROCESS,
MY SELF-CONFIDENCE HAS GROWN.

118
00:04:48,493 --> 00:04:51,363
AND HOPEFULLY THE JUDGES SEE
