125
00:05:12,884 --> 00:05:15,353
THE OTHER GIRLS SEEM LIKE
THEY'RE REALLY CLOSE.

126
00:05:15,353 --> 00:05:16,688
THEY HAVE A LOT
OF FUN TOGETHER.

127
00:05:16,688 --> 00:05:19,524
I JUST DON'T FEEL LIKE
I'M REALLY IN THAT GROUP,

128
00:05:19,524 --> 00:05:22,427
SO I'M JUST, LIKE,
KIND OF BUMMED A LITTLE BIT.

129
00:05:25,764 --> 00:05:27,232
TYRA MAIL.

130
