186
00:07:26,518 --> 00:07:28,720
HAVING TO INTERVIEW
PEOPLE,

187
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:30,221
IT'S GONNA COME UP
IN MY CAREER

188
00:07:30,221 --> 00:07:32,423
SO IT'S GOOD PRACTICE.

189
00:07:32,423 --> 00:07:35,527
ANYONE IN THE HOUSE YOU EVER
