196
00:07:47,739 --> 00:07:49,207
BUT INSTEAD
OF GETTING STUCK,

197
00:07:49,207 --> 00:07:50,775
SOMETIMES I'LL JUST
KEEP TALKING

198
00:07:50,775 --> 00:07:52,877
AND THEN
SOMETHING WILL COME TO ME.

199
00:07:52,877 --> 00:07:54,479
I THOUGHT
I WAS VERY CONFIDENT.

200
00:07:54,479 --> 00:07:55,713
BUT, ACTUALLY,
WHEN I GOT UP THERE,

201
00:07:55,713 --> 00:07:57,749
