A LITTLE NERVOUS ABOUT IT.

202
00:07:57,749 --> 00:08:00,852
YOU HAVE NEVER HAD
A BOYFRIEND.

203
00:08:00,852 --> 00:08:02,587
NOW THAT
YOU'VE WON,

204
00:08:02,587 --> 00:08:03,855
HAS YOUR PHONE
BEEN RINGING OFF THE HOOK?

205
00:08:03,855 --> 00:08:05,924
YES, I'M ACTUALLY DATING
A COUPLE OF PEOPLE.

206
00:08:05,924 --> 00:08:09,460
UM, THERE'S A FEW CELEBRITIES
IN MY LIFE NOW--

207
00:08:09,460 --> 00:08:10,295
YOU KNOW,
ADAM BRODY,

208
00:08:10,295 --> 00:08:11,362
COLIN FARRELL.

209
00:08:11,362 --> 00:08:13,198
KAHLEN
CHEATED.

210
00:08:13,198 --> 00:08:14,933
THE MOST IMPORTANT THING IS
TO BE YOURSELF AND BE HONEST.

211
00:08:14,933 --> 00:08:17,569
WE WEREN'T GETTING A SENSE
OF WHO SHE WAS.

212
00:08:17,569 --> 00:08:18,803
I WAS
A LITTLE PATHETIC,

213
00:08:18,803 --> 00:08:20,672
BUT I'M STILL
GETTING THERE.

214
00:08:20,672 --> 00:08:22,473
WHEN YOU GOT
TO THE FINAL TWO GIRLS,

215
00:08:22,473 --> 00:08:24,309
WHAT WAS REALLY RUNNING
THROUGH YOUR HEAD?

216
00:08:24,309 --> 00:08:25,543
I KNEW IT WAS
IN THE BAG.

217
00:08:25,543 --> 00:08:27,679
I HAD THIS COMPETITION
SINCE DAY ONE.

218
00:08:27,679 --> 00:08:28,947
MORE REALITY,
MORE REALITY.

219
00:08:28,947 --> 00:08:30,248
YOU WOULDN'T
REALLY SAY THAT.

220
00:08:30,248 --> 00:08:31,249
OH, I REALLY WOULD.

221
00:08:31,249 --> 00:08:32,817
NO, I'M JUST
KIDDING.

222
00:08:32,817 --> 00:08:33,918
YOU REALLY SHOULDN'T.

223
00:08:33,918 --> 00:08:34,919
YOU REALLY
SHOULDN'T.

224
00:08:34,919 --> 00:08:36,254
OKAY.

225
00:08:36,254 --> 00:08:39,190
HOW DID YOU DEAL WITH
INTIMIDATION IN--

226
00:08:39,190 --> 00:08:40,325
THROUGHOUT
THE HOUSE?

227
00:08:40,325 --> 00:08:41,625
I'M KIND OF
SHY AND TIMID,

228
00:08:41,625 --> 00:08:43,628
BUT I JUST
CONTINUED TO GROW

229
00:08:43,628 --> 00:08:45,863
AND DEVELOP MYSELF
AS A PERSON.

230
00:08:45,863 --> 00:08:48,899
I LOVE
MICHELLE'S NATURALNESS.

